# Front-End Development & UI/UX Standards

- **Component-Driven Development**: Break applications into minimal, composable, reusable components with clear prop interfaces.
- **Naming Conventions**: PascalCase for components, camelCase for hooks and variables, kebab-case for file/directory paths.
- **Accessibility & Standards**: Semantic HTML (`<button>`, `<header>`, `<main>`), keyboard navigation with `:focus-visible`, WCAG AA contrast standards.
- **Responsive Layouts**: Modern CSS Grid and Flexbox with relative units and responsive breakpoints.
